1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
I handled a case study...

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,800
...about toxic managers and employees.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,200
I am Dr. Hema Prasad, Psychologist.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,900
I know a young boy...

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,500
...who was very smart.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,000
At a very young age,

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,800
he got an MNC job.

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,800
As he was working there,

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,800
his colleagues were much older.

10
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,100
When he performed so well,

11
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:33,300
and did his job well,

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,800
his salary kept increasing.

13
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,000
Compared to his colleagues,

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,500
his salary was double.

15
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,500
They felt very jealous...

16
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,300
...and constantly criticized him.

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,000
Right to his face,

18
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
they used vulgar language

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,500
and abused him constantly.

20
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,800
This drove him into depression.

21
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:58,700
Later, he came to me.

22
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:01,300
After he came to me,

23
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:05,100
when we analyzed the situation,

24
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,700
the work environment around him...

25
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:10,800
He just wanted to work happily.

26
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,600
He was very knowledgeable

27
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:16,800
and collaborated with everyone.

28
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:20,100
Their goal to push him out

29
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:23,000
and the toxic thoughts around

30
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,100
severely impacted his life.

